{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42376","headline":"奉和子龙大监与舍弟赠答之什 · 徐铉","name":"奉和子龙大监与舍弟赠答之什","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"石渠东观两优贤，明主知臣岂偶然。\n鸳鹭分行皆接武，金兰同好共忘年。\n怀恩未遂林泉约，窃位空慙组绶悬。\n多少深情知不尽，好音相慰强成篇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42376.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42376","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}